-content/uploads/2020/02/DSC_1216-150x150.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/02/DSC_1216-150x150.jpg 150w, https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/02/DSC_1216-45x45.jpg 45w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px\" /></a>\n\t\t\t</dt></dl><dl class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<dt class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https://www.thefixmagazine.com/review-delectable-delta-blues-at-the-louisiana-with-daddy-long-legs/dsc_1222/#main'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/02/DSC_1222-150x150.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/02/DSC_1222-150x150.jpg 150w, https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/02/DSC_1222-45x45.jpg 45w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px\" /></a>\n\t\t\t</dt></dl><dl class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<dt class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https://www.thefixmagazine.com/review-delectable-delta-blues-at-the-louisiana-with-daddy-long-legs/dsc_1225/#main'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/02/DSC_1225-150x150.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/02/DSC_1225-150x150.jpg 150w, https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/02/DSC_1225-45x45.jpg 45w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px\" /></a>\n\t\t\t</dt></dl><br style=\"clear: both\" /><dl class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<dt class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https://www.thefixmagazine.com/review-delectable-delta-blues-at-the-louisiana-with-daddy-long-legs/dsc_1255/#main'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/02/DSC_1255-150x150.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/02/DSC_1255-150x150.jpg 150w, https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/02/DSC_1255-45x45.jpg 45w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px\" /></a>\n\t\t\t</dt></dl><dl class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<dt class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https://www.thefixmagazine.com/review-delectable-delta-blues-at-the-louisiana-with-daddy-long-legs/dsc_1285/#main'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/02/DSC_1285-150x150.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/02/DSC_1285-150x150.jpg 150w, https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/02/DSC_1285-45x45.jpg 45w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px\" /></a>\n\t\t\t</dt></dl>\n\t\t\t<br style='clear: both' />\n\t\t</div>\n\n<p>&#8220;Clap your hands and stomp your feet&#8221; implores Hurd as they bash through &#8216;<em>Evil Eye</em>&#8216;, with an ode to blues legend Howling Wolf with is unmistakable  refrain of &#8220;howl, howl, howl.&#8221;</p>\n<p>Throughout Murat Akturk (on guitar) provides the eye of the storm and has more than a hint of Johnny Marr about him, armed with slide, silk shirt and slick mod style.</p>\n<p>Drummer Josh Styles provides the relentless rhythm, brandishing his maracas at each member of the band and audience with a menacing psychosis of a (non-homicidal) Phil Spector, bespectacled with trademark dark shades.</p>\n<p>&#8220;Give Daddy the guitar&#8221; whispers Josh Styles as Hurd moves over to guitar before they launch into <em>&#8216;Bad Neighbourhood&#8217;</em>.</p>\n<p>Overwhelmed by the Louisaina heat Hurd finally relinquishes his western bow tie to reveal a sweaty mess underneath, although he is at pains to note that they are &#8220;not even fucking close to done yet.&#8221;</p>\n<p>After a short break which they they tell us was &#8220;just  needed refills on these beers&#8221; they return for a short encore that climaxes with closer <em>&#8216;Motocycle Madness&#8217;</em>. Initiated with the Daytona hum of Hurd&#8217;s harmoica shuffle it&#8217;s the perfect end to a incredible night that is sure to reset anyone&#8217;s love for Americana. </p>\n<p><iframe loading=\"lazy\" title=\"Daddy Long Legs-NYC,Shackin&#039; Up, Motorcycle Madness\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/FI9beIj50Dc?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe></p>\n<p>With a fearsome, infectious energy that borders on <span data-dobid=\"hdw\">zealotry, <em>Daddy Long Legs</em> are here to save the Blues and we couldn&#8217;t be happier.</span></p>\n<p><strong>To find out more about <em>Daddy Long Legs </em>click <a href=\"http://officialdaddylonglegs.com/index.html\">here</a>.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Kevin McGough<br />\n Pictures by <a href=\"http://www.willfahyphoto.com/\">Will Fahy</a><br />\n </strong></p>\n<p><span></span></p>",
